  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - TEI Health System Brussel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - TEI H&#xe4;lsosystem Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser sekundering av en nationell expert till INTPA A2, med placering i Bryssel. Arbetsuppgifterna inkluderar att leda och koordinera Team Europe Initiative med syfte att st&#xf6;dja African National Public Health Institutes (TEI PHI) i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med Kommissionen. Initiativet beslutades inom ramen f&#xf6;r &#x201d;the Global Gateway Health Package&#x201d; i samband med EU-AU:s sj&#xe4;tte toppm&#xf6;te 2022, och syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra befolkningens h&#xe4;lsa genom tillhandah&#xe5;llande av viktiga h&#xe4;lsotj&#xe4;nster.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secondment of a national expert to INTPA A2, based in Brussels. Duties include leading and coordinating the Team Europe Initiative to support the African National Public Health Institutes (TEI PHI) in close collaboration with the Commission. The initiative was decided within the framework of &quot;the Global Gateway Health Package&quot; in connection with the sixth EU-AU summit in 2022 and aims to improve the health of the population through the provision of essential health services.</narrative>
  </description>
